{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49022","headline":"蜀中经蛮後寄陶雍 · 马乂","name":"蜀中经蛮後寄陶雍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酋马渡泸水，北来如鸟轻。\n几年期凤阙，一日破龟城。\n此地有征战，谁家无死生。\n人悲还旧里，鸟喜下空营。\n弟侄意初定，交朋心尚惊。\n自从经难後，吟苦似猨声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}